cha via 2captcha API ino one of that IPs \r\n- if you got BAD KEY error, just tru another IP \r\n- enjoy! :) \r\n- (its not work for hCaptcha!) \r\n \r\nWARNING: Free XEvil DEMO does NOT support ReCaptcha, hCaptcha and most other types of captcha! \r\n \r\nhttp://xrumersale.site/',1,1,'2026-05-14 23:40:58'),(2661,'RobertFrits','brahamperry76@gmail.com','Hallo, i am writing about your   price','Salam, qiymətinizi bilmək istədim.',1,1,'2026-05-14 23:49:17'),(2662,'RobertFrits','4802361996@tmomail.net','Hi  i writing about your   price','Sawubona, bengifuna ukwazi intengo yakho.',1,1,'2026-05-14 23:52:15'),(2663,'RobertFrits','brahamperry76@gmail.com','Hi,   writing about your   prices','Zdravo, htio sam znati vašu cijenu.',1,1,'2026-05-15 00:08:00'),(2664,'RobertFrits','rosseri3msu@gmail.com','Hi,   writing about     price for reseller','Hi, roeddwn i eisiau gwybod eich pris.',1,1,'2026-05-15 01:23:19'),(2665,'RobertFrits','amandabuckstein@gmail.com','Aloha    writing about   the price','Γεια σου, ήθελα να μάθω την τιμή σας.',1,1,'2026-05-15 01:27:57'),(2666,'RobertFrits','amandabuckstein@gmail.com','Hello  i am writing about     price for reseller','Hej, jeg ønskede at kende din pris.',1,1,'2026-05-15 01:39:18'),(2667,'RobertFrits','rich@dealershiptoolkit.com','Hallo,   wrote about   the prices','Dia duit, theastaigh uaim do phraghas a fháil.',1,1,'2026-05-15 02:48:17'),(2668,'RobertFrits','keanna@chunter.ca','Aloha, i writing about   the prices','Xin chào, tôi muốn biết giá của bạn.',1,1,'2026-05-15 03:12:41'),(2669,'RobertFrits','rich@dealershiptoolkit.com','Hi  i wrote about your   prices','Прывітанне, я хацеў даведацца Ваш прайс.',1,1,'2026-05-15 03:22:22'),(2670,'RobertFrits','keanna@chunter.ca','Hi, i am write about your   price','Szia, meg akartam tudni az árát.',1,1,'2026-05-15 03:29:34'),(2671,'RobertFrits','rich@dealershiptoolkit.com','Hi    write about   the price','Hej, jeg ønskede at kende din pris.',1,1,'2026-05-15 04:04:45'),(2672,'RobertFrits','rich@d